      "writtenOn": "2012-07-11T13:13:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we should wait till this happen. 25ms is too long. And we didn\u0027t enable PEC, so that should be ignored.\n\nwait_status() timeout will be changed to 10ms, same as i2c slave mode. Experiments on snow/daisy showed that most communication event latency is less than 2ms.",
