        "id": 1000160
      },
      "writtenOn": "2012-07-11T13:13:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. This means i2c_claim_port() failed. Since we didn\u0027t touch any I2C registers, it is safe to return from here without touch hardware.",
